        ↓
SIEM Alert Generated
        ↓
SOC Analyst Investigates
        ↓
Threat Confirmed
        ↓
User Account Locked

3. Security Analysts
Detailed Definition
Security Analysts are professionals responsible for monitoring and investigating security events.
The objective:
"Detect and respond to threats quickly."

Responsibilities
Examples:
