Detailed Definition

SOC Analyst stands for Security Operations Center Analyst.

SOC analysts continuously monitor systems and investigate security alerts.

Objective:

"Detect threats and respond quickly."

Responsibilities

Examples:

Monitor SIEM alerts
Review logs
Investigate suspicious activities
Escalate incidents
Document findings
Skills Required

Examples:

Networking
SIEM tools
Log analysis
Incident handling
