500 failed logins

↓

SOC Analyst investigates.

2. Security Analyst
Detailed Definition

Security Analysts identify security weaknesses and improve security posture.

Objective:

"Protect systems and reduce risk."

Responsibilities

Examples:

Vulnerability assessment
